; diff.no — diff utility
; Compare files line by line
; Usage: diff [-u|-c|-q] FILE1 FILE2
;   -u: unified format (3 lines context)
;   -c: context format (3 lines context)
;   -q: brief mode, only report if files differ
; Exit: 0=same, 1=differ, 2=error
; 注意：format-range/emit-normal/emit-unified/diff-run 已移至 diffengine.no
; 原因：这些函数使用 []diff-op struct，跨模块导入会导致 codegen 失败
; 现在通过 # /notools/src/diffengine.diff-run 从 diffengine 直接导入
